	(text "X1: the YACC1 V3.2 bus (DIN 41612). IC1 compares ADDR15-12 with SV1 (5-6 fitted: the $D000 block). The block's\ntwo halves: TXTCE (IC37/A), the text RAM at $D000-$D7FF; GSEL (IC23/A), the graphics window at $D800-$DFFF, with\nits write strobe GWR and its read GRDOE. IC2 decodes IO-ADDR0-3: ports PA-PF = 1010-1111; IC3 / IC4 gate each\nselect with a strobe. IC5 = control 1 (OUT PC), IC6 = control 2 (OUT PF), IC7 = the status (IN PC): the ID 0111." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ffb7bcec-cc0a-544f-9c23-f68b822d5724"))
	(embedded_fonts no)
)
